{"id":"1f76d7169bd6833b","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-term-operation.md","title":"Term Operation","display":"Term Operation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-term-operation","aliases":["93-lem-term-operation"],"display":"Term Operation","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-deterministic]]","[[93-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-term-operation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-term-operation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Term Operation"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-term-operation---Term-Operation\">lem-term-operation - Term Operation</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\">\\(X=\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TupleVal}_{93}(\\bar a;\\bar x,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{TupleVal}_{93}(\\bar a;\\bar x,n)\\)</span> is the assignment graph defined here; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\)</span> is the recursion of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}term\\text{-}operation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TupleVal}_{93}(\\bar a;\\bar x,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\bar x(i),\\bar a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}term\\text{-}operation}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TupleVal}_{93}(\\bar a;\\bar x,n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\bar x(i),\\bar a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}term\\text{-}operation}\\vdash\n\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\land\\bar a\\in A^n\n\\to\\operatorname{TupleVal}_{93}(\\bar a;\\bar x,n):\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\to A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}term\\text{-}operation}\\vdash\n\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\land\\bar a\\in A^n\n\\to\\operatorname{TupleVal}_{93}(\\bar a;\\bar x,n):\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\to A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}term\\text{-}operation}\\vdash{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land X=\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists!f\\;\\Bigl(f:|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|\\land\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\;\nf(\\bar a)=\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\n\\operatorname{TupleVal}_{93}(\\bar a;\\bar x,n)}(t)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}term\\text{-}operation}\\vdash{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land X=\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Term}_{93}(t;\\tau,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists!f\\;\\Bigl(f:|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|\\land\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\;\nf(\\bar a)=\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{\n\\operatorname{TupleVal}_{93}(\\bar a;\\bar x,n)}(t)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Each term determines a canonical operation on every algebra of the same type.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-term-operation---Term-Operation","text":"lem-term-operation - Term Operation","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depend